see on ajastu mنrk.

954
01:28:35.168 --> 01:28:38.349
Kنes on viimne etendus.

955
01:28:39.285 --> 01:28:42.828
Loodan, et kannad parimaid rُivaid.

956
01:28:44.616 --> 01:28:49.428
Pistisega taevasse ei pننse.

957
01:28:51.381 --> 01:28:54.921
Nنed siin allgi vنlja hea.

958
01:28:55.125 --> 01:29:00.644
