Me ei ُpi eal. Oleme olnud siin.

960
01:29:04.301 --> 01:29:07.644
Miks me jنnni jننme ja pageme?

961
01:29:07.744 --> 01:29:09.597
Kuulide eest?

962
01:29:11.900 --> 01:29:13.509
Kuulide eest?

963
01:29:16.800 --> 01:29:18.830
Jنta nutt,

964
01:29:18.930 --> 01:29:21.559
see on ajastu mنrk.

965
01:29:23.193 --> 01:29:26.808
Me peame pننsema siit.

966
01:29:27.108 --> 01:29:30.357
Me peame pننsema siit.

967
01:29:32.666 --> 01:29:35.143
Jنta nutt,

968
01:29:35.243 --> 01:29:37.535
kُik korda saab.

969
01:29:38.982 --> 01:29:42.489
Mulle ِeldi, et lُpp on ligi.

970
01:29:43.117 --> 01:29:46.335
Me peame pننsema siit.

971
01:29:48.649 --> 01:29:50.812
