- Jah?

1025
01:35:37.997 --> 01:35:40.130
Elu. Elu on pُhjuseks!

1026
01:35:40.230 --> 01:35:42.528
Tنppi panid, semu. Elu on pُhjuseks.

1027
01:35:42.628 --> 01:35:44.200
Ei saa aru.

1028
01:35:44.300 --> 01:35:46.106
Kasuta sُnu.
Elu on mille pُhjuseks?

1029
01:35:46.206 --> 01:35:48.666
Elu on pُhjuseks.
- Elu on mille pُhjuseks?

1030
01:35:48.766 --> 01:35:50.844
Elu on pُhjuseks.

1031
01:35:50.944 --> 01:35:52.637
Elu on mille pُhjuseks?

1032
01:35:52.737 --> 01:35:55.640
