1036
01:36:05.390 --> 01:36:08.488
Grace, kui me kiskja koju viime,
siis meie tنhed ei sure.

1037
01:36:08.588 --> 01:36:11.622
Elu on pُhjuseks, miks tنht ei sure.

1038
01:36:12.999 --> 01:36:14.967
Miks sa kohe ei ِelnud?

1039
01:36:15.367 --> 01:36:18.165
<i>Kui Adrianil elab mingit sorti
mikroobne kiskja,</i>

1040
01:36:18.265 --> 01:36:21.330
