1059
01:37:16.689 --> 01:37:18.723
Aga ma olen harjutanud, kas pole?

1060
01:37:18.823 --> 01:37:20.395
Rohkem! Ei. Vasakule.

1061
01:37:20.495 --> 01:37:23.431
