1083
01:38:32.798 --> 01:38:34.735
Miks sa mulle ei ِelnud?

1084
01:38:35.607 --> 01:38:36.977
Ununes.

1085
01:38:37.077 --> 01:38:39.573
Ei. Grace ütles, et Grace lنheb koju.

1086
01:38:41.246 --> 01:38:44.148
