- Ei.

1087
01:38:45.052 --> 01:38:49.286
Sain vُimaluse sinuga tutvuda.
Teha kُiki neid imelisi asju.

1088
01:38:49.386 --> 01:38:51.782
Olen olukorraga leppinud.

1089
01:38:52.518 --> 01:38:54.654
