1094
01:39:06.723 --> 01:39:10.571
Pِidlad püsti? - Ei.
- Tillukesed pِidlad püsti? - Ei.

1095
01:39:10.671 --> 01:39:13.276
Tنhed ootavad pننstmist. Eks?

1096
01:39:18.085 --> 01:39:20.217
